  "Posted 'Darth Vader(sith)' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'R2-Q2' dested R2-Q2 (Artoo-Kyootoo); 'Colonel David Jon' dested Colonel Davod Jon; 'U-3PO' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio).",
  "Posted 'Secret Plans' (under Effects) dested the Special Edition Effect Secret Plans, not the later Defensive Shield; 'Sense' dested Sense (Dark) (Premiere); 'Alter/Collateral Damage' dested Alter & Collateral Damage; 'Boba Fett In Slave One' dested Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Bossk In Houndstooth' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth."
